 <p class="text-center text-slate-500 text-sm max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-12">High-wattage power banks command premium pricing and target the fastest-growing segment of portable power: laptop and multi-device users.</p>

 <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
 <div class="card p-6 shadow-sm">
 <h3 class="font-black text-brandBlue uppercase mb-3 text-sm">Digital Nomad Market Growth</h3>
 <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Remote workers need all-day laptop power away from outlets. The digital nomad market grows 20%+ YoY — portable laptop charging is their top gear priority.</p>
 </div>
 <div class="card p-6 shadow-sm">
 <h3 class="font-black text-brandBlue uppercase mb-3 text-sm">Premium Pricing ($50-120 Retail)</h3>
 <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Laptop power banks retail at 3-5x the price of phone power banks. Higher wattage = higher margins for your brand with the same shelf space.</p>
 </div>
 <div class="card p-6 shadow-sm">
 <h3 class="font-black text-brandBlue uppercase mb-3 text-sm">Corporate & Enterprise Demand</h3>
 <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">IT departments bulk-order laptop power banks for field teams, trade shows, and executive travel kits. B2B reorder rates exceed 40%.</p>
 </div>
 <div class="card p-6 shadow-sm">
 <h3 class="font-black text-brandBlue uppercase mb-3 text-sm">MacBook Compatibility Differentiator</h3>
 <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">"Charges MacBook Pro" is the #1 search filter on Amazon power bank listings. PD 3.1 support puts your SKU in the premium tier automatically.</p>
 </div>
 <div class="card p-6 shadow-sm">
 <h3 class="font-black text-brandBlue uppercase mb-3 text-sm">UN38.3 for Global Shipping</h3>
 <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">All models ship with UN38.3 test reports, MSDS, and air transport documentation. Sell globally without compliance delays at customs.</p>
 </div>
 <div class="card p-6 shadow-sm">
 <h3 class="font-black text-brandBlue uppercase mb-3 text-sm">Amazon Laptop Charger Category</h3>
 <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Amazon's "Laptop Portable Charger" sub-category has lower competition and higher AOV than generic power banks. PD 3.1 listings rank faster.</p>
 </div>
 </div>
 </div>
</section>
