 <p class="text-center text-slate-500 text-sm max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12">How many watts does your customer's laptop need? This table shows the minimum power bank wattage required to charge popular laptops at full speed — helping you choose the right WOWOHCOOL model for your target market.</p>

