 <h2 class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-black text-brandBlue uppercase italic tracking-tighter mb-4 text-center">Airline-Safe: <span class="text-brandOrange">100Wh Compliance</span></h2>
 <p class="text-center text-slate-500 text-sm max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12">All WOWOHCOOL laptop power banks are designed to stay under the 100Wh IATA carry-on limit — no airline pre-approval needed. Here's how the math works: Wh = mAh × Voltage ÷ 1000.</p>

